    <item>
      <title>Apple Card 業務虧損嚴重　由大通接手服務不變</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/01/10/apple-card-chase-partnership-goldman-sachs-exit/life-tech/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=apple-card-chase-partnership-goldman-sachs-exit</link>
      <description>Apple 與大通（Chase）於 1 月 7 日宣布，大通將成為 Apple Card 新發卡機構，預計 24 個月內完成轉換。這項合作結束高盛（Goldman Sachs）自 2019 年以來擔任 Apple Card 發卡機構角色，高盛曾因這項業務損失超過 60 億美元（約港幣 468 億元）。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/01/10/apple-card-chase-partnership-goldman-sachs-exit/life-tech/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=apple-card-chase-partnership-goldman-sachs-exit</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 11:00:06 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Bose 開源舊款智能喇叭系統　避免雲端服務結束後裝置「變磚」</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/01/10/bose-soundtouch-api-open-source-support/mobile-music/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=bose-soundtouch-api-open-source-support</link>
      <description>Bose 宣布將旗下 SoundTouch 系列智能喇叭的 API 技術文件開源，讓獨立開發者為這些裝置開發新工具及功能。這項決定在科技產業相當罕見，多數廠商停止雲端服務支援時，通常會讓產品失去功能「變磚」，相當浪費。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/01/10/bose-soundtouch-api-open-source-support/mobile-music/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=bose-soundtouch-api-open-source-support</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 13:00:10 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>YouTube 推出 Shorts 過濾功能　用戶可排除短片搜尋結果</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/01/10/youtube-search-filter-update-shorts-long-video/software/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=youtube-search-filter-update-shorts-long-video</link>
      <description>YouTube 宣布更新搜尋過濾功能，讓用戶可選擇在搜尋結果中顯示長影片或短片。新功能在「類型」選單新增專門選項，用戶可選擇「影片」只顯示長影片，或選擇「Shorts」只顯示短片內容，解決過往搜尋結果混合兩種格式的困擾。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/01/10/youtube-search-filter-update-shorts-long-video/software/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=youtube-search-filter-update-shorts-long-video</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.unwire.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/20260110_002708-694x403.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 14:00:20 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
